h ascending for wano i  gotta say this chapter for me was the  perfect cherry on the wano cake yes we  got a potentially huge reveal with  yamato but also just such a rewarding  conclusion to this long long arc the  only thing that could possibly make this  better is if you smash that like button  and set off the youtube fireworks and  celebrate along with wano and the nakama  yes always be a smashing pirate king and  not a passing orochi that is always my  message to you make this the video you  officially joined the nakama by  subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece chapter reviews and updates  finally feel free to check out my one  piece playlist on the screen which  includes videos in all the yonko  mythical zones admirals and much more  link to that playlist and other relevant  videos will be in the description as  well and until next time see you space  cowboys

